target
# Crashing inputs libFuzzer writes out. A reproducer belongs in a unit test in
# the crate that owns the parser, not as a loose file here.
artifacts
coverage

# `corpus/` is deliberately NOT ignored. cargo-fuzz's own template ignores it,
# which is how a project ends up fuzzing from noise on every fresh checkout.
# The seeds under it come from `scripts/fuzz.sh seed` and are part of the tree.
